      en: ["The cathedral was built between 1093 and 1133, taking only 40 years to complete.", "It contains the shrines of St Cuthbert and the Venerable Bede.", "The cathedral was the first in the world to feature a structural ribbed vault.", "The central tower stands 66 meters tall and houses a peal of 10 bells.", "It was designated a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1986 along with Durham Castle.", "The cathedral's cloisters were used to film scenes of Hogwarts in Harry Potter."],
